OL,3,GNEWSACar crashes through railings and
OL,4,Ahits school building
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has hit a school gym in
OL,7,FLeicestershire after crashing through
OL,8,Fnearby railings.
OL,10,FLeicestershire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,11,Fsaid it happened at Limehurst Academy
OL,12,Fin Loughborough shortly after 18:00 BST
OL,13,Fon Monday.
OL,15,FThe service said two crews, which
OL,16,Fattended the scene to make the vehicle
OL,17,Fsafe, found no-one was trapped or
OL,18,Finjured.
OL,20,FLeicestershire Police confirmed no-one
OL,21,Fwas arrested following the crash.
